description:
Exposes the AutoCAD Sheet Set Manager to Dynamo.
Supports Civil 3D @SUPPORTED_YEARS@ in a single package; the right build loads automatically.
Currently allows:
creation and editing of Sheet Sets;
creation and editing of Sheets;
creation and editing of Subsets;
creation and editing of Custom Properties.
Sample graphs have been provided in the extra folder.
For questions or input, you can reach me on LinkedIn or Facebook at @AdammReilly.
